    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "HUD & In-Vehicle Signals"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "To make coaching feel native to the car, I partnered with the software-integration and ML teams to ground the HMI in real vehicle state: pulling live signals from the Vehicle SDK and CAN bus into updated HUD concepts, so guidance stays synced to actual speed, position, and steering input, not a simulated approximation."
    },
