        "title": "Simulation & Testing"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Validating in CARLA"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Working with the ML and research teams, I connected coaching designs to CARLA, Woven’s proprietary simulation platform, to run realistic driving scenarios and pressure-test coaching behavior before it ever touched a real vehicle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/nIKhkPkhxDdZrcxJNJAM0dPvX3M.jpg",
      "alt": "",
