      "controls": {
        "title": "Physical Prototyping"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "From Figma to the Driver’s Seat"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Feedback moved fast, so I kept prototypes moving just as fast: voice-enabled Figma flows for early concept testing, full simulator scenarios, and a physical rig with a real steering wheel and pedal controls.\n\nTesting on physical controls surfaced timing and tone issues a screen-only prototype never would catch. Coaching that feels right in Figma can feel intrusive the moment your hands are actually on the wheel."
    },
